description: Review flags for Scalewing pull requests
alwaysApply: true
---

# Review

- Flag React Native imports in `@scalewing/react`.
- Flag React DOM or CSS class APIs in `@scalewing/react-native`.
- Flag hand-written CSS that duplicates the generator.
- Flag examples that vendor Scalewing CSS in app source.
- Flag production dependencies added without a rationale.
- Flag secrets, npm tokens, or `.env` files.
- Flag arbitrary utility classes, glass-utility matrices, and new full CSS frameworks.
